<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - James River raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - James River raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston raised James River Corp to a buy from a hold.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/4 to 31-1/4.</p>
</text>
